{"_ensure_processes_alive only calls process.kill() for multiprocessing.Process, so threading.Thread workers are not properly terminated when restarting unhealthy workers": 0.7592003345489502, "_create_process_for_shards can spawn duplicate threading.Thread workers when produce_to_pipe is set because old threads are not stopped/joined before creating replacements": 0.839708149433136, "Need to either stop/join old threads before creating replacements, or short-circuit restarts entirely for the threaded path to prevent duplicate workers handling the same shard group": 0.8526614904403687}